description.narrative:
During the project implementation the following results were achieved:

- Procurement and installing of the container, its connection to the electricity line (building up the pillars) and arrangement of the space for the sorting station (fencing, making the flooring, access road);

- Manual extraction / sorting of the plastics from the waste dump;

- Fencing the waste dump, thus avoiding uncontrolled access and dumping of the waste, installing the lightning and the video monitoring ;

- Compaction of waste and Road rehabilitation in order to secure the proper access of tractors;

- Containers for separate plastic waste and paper collection;

- Purchase of plastic and paper ballot press and installation;

- Balloting of the plastics and transportation to the authorized plastic recycler. The total quantity of 1.2 tons of plastic, extracted manually from the waste dump was pressed into ballots and send to the authorized recycler for its further processing;

- Establishment of the contract between Palanca Mayoralty and ABS recycling company was concluded and it allows Palanca to sell the balloted quantities of plastic waste for recycling;

- Refugee temporary reception center staff was trained on how to separate and minimize the waste generated by rendering humanitarian support services.

- Information and public awareness activities were organized in partnership with the Local and raional public authorities and with support of local NGO Icar Dedal;
